1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,551
Two agents.

2
00:00:01,551 --> 00:00:04,870
Same goal, same plan, same simulated world.

3
00:00:04,870 --> 00:00:06,700
Then reality changes.

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,778
At tick six, route R1 closes.

5
00:00:09,778 --> 00:00:13,673
KEEL finds the one step that assumed R1 was open,

6
00:00:13,673 --> 00:00:16,293
keeps the three finished steps,

7
00:00:16,293 --> 00:00:18,559
and repairs only the rest.

8
00:00:18,559 --> 00:00:22,950
The repair was a recorded model proposal, validated now.

9
00:00:23,599 --> 00:00:26,999
The static agent drives on, and learns too late.

10
00:00:29,066 --> 00:00:32,916
Every number here is recomputed from the event log.

11
00:00:33,699 --> 00:00:35,552
A failover target degrades.

12
00:00:35,552 --> 00:00:39,874
KEEL re-checks before shifting traffic, and moves checkout to region C.

13
00:00:41,866 --> 00:00:45,686
The static plan sends checkout into the degraded region,

14
00:00:45,686 --> 00:00:47,658
and still reports success.

15
00:00:47,658 --> 00:00:49,691
KEEL never served an error.

16
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:53,387
Now a forged report, and a flapping sensor.

17
00:00:53,387 --> 00:00:55,277
The forgery is rejected.

18
00:00:55,277 --> 00:00:59,625
When the readings oscillate, KEEL pauses, and asks an operator.

19
00:01:02,366 --> 00:01:05,156
One confirmation, and KEEL delivers.

20
00:01:05,156 --> 00:01:09,141
The naive agent followed the noise onto a closed road.

21
00:01:10,199 --> 00:01:12,156
Crash the agent mid-step.

22
00:01:12,156 --> 00:01:14,744
It rebuilds from its persisted log:

23
00:01:14,744 --> 00:01:17,899
finished work kept, no effect applied twice.

24
00:01:22,133 --> 00:01:24,258
Tested on SQLite and Postgres,

25
00:01:24,258 --> 00:01:25,498
in the browser,

26
00:01:25,498 --> 00:01:27,742
and through a kill-and-takeover.

27
00:01:27,742 --> 00:01:29,808
Everything here is simulated.

28
00:01:29,808 --> 00:01:30,458
KEEL:

29
00:01:30,458 --> 00:01:31,993
the plan can change.

30
00:01:31,993 --> 00:01:33,233
The goal stays.
